<Slide style={{ width: 1280, height: 720, padding: '20px 64px', background: '#FFFFFF', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column' }}>
    <Box style={{ height: 84, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', justifyContent: 'center', gap: 6 }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 36, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
            怎么设置的 ②：口径、门禁、改动纪律
        </Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 16, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>
            先把「怎么算对」钉死，再开始改代码
        </Text>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ flex: 1, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', gap: 24, alignItems: 'stretch' }}>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 22px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, borderTop: '4px solid #3B82F6' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>基线双口径</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                本机默认 <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>9304</Text>：跨语言层缺 Python 依赖，7 条显式跳过。
                装上后 <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>9382</Text>：7 条跳过变实跑。
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                判据看构建日志：SKIPPED=0 是 9382，SKIPPED=7 是 9304。
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '9px 12px', background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 600, color: '#1A1A1A', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    任何报告必须写清用的是哪个口径
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 22px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, borderTop: '4px solid #3B82F6' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>55 项交付门禁</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                12/ 验收器跑七维度 <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>55</Text> 项检查：功能 9 / 策略 9 / 安全 11 / 性能 5 / 稳定性 7 / 协同 8 / 文档 6。
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                产出正式验收报告（md/json/html），不是只印几行日志——产物要能被第三方逐条复核。
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '9px 12px', background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 600, color: '#1A1A1A', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    本次验收 55/55 通过，退出码 0
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
        <Box style={{ flex: 1, background: '#F8FAFC', borderRadius: 12, padding: '20px 22px', display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'column', gap: 10, borderTop: '4px solid #3B82F6' }}>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 22, fontWeight: 'bold', color: '#1A1A1A', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>追加式改动</Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                点表只能追加在末尾——索引就是运行时坐标，中间插入等于全系统错位。新增参数默认行为不变。
            </Text>
            <Text style={{ fontSize: 15, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', lineHeight: 1.7 }}>
                环境缺失时允许跳过，但必须显式宣布（总是印 SKIPPED=n），并传到最外层结论行；会进产物的数字从真相源派生，不手抄。
            </Text>
            <Box style={{ marginTop: 'auto', padding: '9px 12px', background: '#EFF6FF', borderRadius: 8 }}>
                <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, fontWeight: 600, color: '#1A1A1A', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei', lineHeight: 1.5 }}>
                    「其余文件逐位不变」也是要验证的东西
                </Text>
            </Box>
        </Box>
    </Box>
    <Box style={{ height: 36, display: 'flex', flexDirection: 'row', justifyContent: 'space-between', alignItems: 'center' }}>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Microsoft YaHei' }}>工商业储能 EMS · 0919-0920 工作汇报</Text>
        <Text style={{ fontSize: 14, color: '#64748B', fontFamily: 'Consolas' }}>04 / 10</Text>
    </Box>
</Slide>
